  "details": "Because this: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F9kUdFyybTk\nSome avatar creators breaks the rules for Quest side. They just copied PC avatar to Quest side, didn't even optimize it.\nReally pointless and VERY rude for Quest side. It's more 'i dont care about Quest' and 200K avatar at quest side? Shame you!\nI know SDK will block upload Quest world if it's over 50MB. But.... why not avatars?\n\nDid SDK block avatars which are have too much polygons? Warning is not good, they will just upload pointless and extremely heavy avatars.\n\nCan you not make it good for Quest? Don't upload it. That is only big shame on your name, avatar creators. You are just bad creator. Quest rules and limits are very clear, obey it or don't upload it. Thank you.\n\nBut some people wont listen... so i want real block on over 20K avatars. This will keep Quest side safe for everyone, and more fun too. Like you block over 50MB to keep it safe.",
